WEBVTT

00:05:27.558 --> 00:05:31.255
I literally thought I was
in the center of the universe.

00:05:33.517 --> 00:05:39.278
So here is my idea worth spreading:

00:05:40.622 --> 00:05:42.201
a lot of people think

00:05:42.225 --> 00:05:46.893
humans inherently know
what is right and wrong,

00:05:46.917 --> 00:05:50.491
the difference between
justice and injustice,

00:05:51.327 --> 00:05:54.411
what we deserve and we don't deserve.

00:05:55.647 --> 00:05:57.540
I tell them: BS.

00:05:58.140 --> 00:05:59.754
(Laughter)

00:05:59.778 --> 00:06:02.015
(Applause)